    "text": "<p>Given,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>{</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8743;</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>}</mo><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>Now solving the above expression using truth table from given options we get,</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>q</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8743;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8801;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>r</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>B</mi></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>A</mi></mfenced></math></td>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t\t<td>F</td>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">T</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">T</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">T</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">T</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">T</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>B</mi></mfenced></math></td>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t\t<td>F</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">T</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">F</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">F</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">F</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">T</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>C</mi></mfenced></math></td>\t\t\t<td>F</td>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t\t<td>F</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">T</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">T</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">T</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">F</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">F</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>D</mi></mfenced></math></td>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t\t<td>F</td>\t\t\t<td>F</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">T</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">F</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">F</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">T</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">T</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>So, only Option&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;will be false.</p>",
